<view class="page">
  <view class="page-header"><view class="page-title">我的订单</view><view class="muted">每一段时光，都为你留着。</view></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">时光清单</view><button class="button secondary" size="mini" disabled="{{loading || busy}}" bindtap="refresh">刷新</button></view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在找回你的订单…</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:elif="{{!orders.length}}">还没有订单。选好照片和玩法后，就会出现在这里。</view>
    <button class="button secondary" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="purchaseId" data-id="{{item.purchaseId}}" bindtap="select" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.seriesTitle || item.title}} · {{item.expectedCount}} 张 · {{item.amountText}} · {{item.stateText}}</button>
    <button class="button secondary" wx:if="{{nextCursor}}" disabled="{{loading || busy}}" bindtap="more">{{loading ? '正在找回' : '更多订单'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{selected}}">
    <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">{{selected.seriesTitle || selected.title}}</view><text class="tag">{{selected.stateText}}</text></view>
    <view class="page-title">{{selected.amountText}}<text class="muted"> / 整单</text></view>
    <view class="muted">共 {{selected.expectedCount}} 张照片{{selected.sku === 'wardrobe-series' ? '，包含本系列全部适用款式' : ''}} · 已备好 {{selected.readyCount}} 张</view>
    <button class="button" wx:if="{{selected.canResume}}" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" bindtap="resume">{{busy ? '正在核对订单' : selected.paymentState === 'paid' ? '继续处理，不重复付款' : '确认订单并继续'}}</button>
    <button class="button secondary" wx:if="{{selected.canOpen}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="open">查看照片与进度</button>
  </view>
  <view class="status" wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}</view><view class="status error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="privacy-foot">付款中断或暂未出片，都可以回到这里继续。支付结果以核验后的订单状态为准。</view>
</view>
